        }
      ],
      "title": "通往地狱之门·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "38612001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "唔……我的腿……好麻……还要这样多久？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "居然可以蹲在这些杂物的缝隙里，又找到一个吓人的方式……就是有点费腿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "这才蹲守了30分钟，助手1号和助手2号都得再练练呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "喂！什么时候我变成你的助手1号了！？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼",
          "text": "啊……助手1号难道不是我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "毕竟在同一个地狱观光团呢，那奇萝可以当助手2号。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "根本不是这个问题——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "嘘！那边好像有脚步声过来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "呼，这就是最后一趟了吧……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "星洛……煮……已经准备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "星洛的名字？！得再听听……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "那些黑影……身上有荧光的液体不断掉下来……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "原来那些就是荧光闪烁的足迹。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "他们要消失在箱子后面了，我先追上去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "等——！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "站住！你们这些闯入的坏人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38612017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "不许追我的朋友！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38716001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "唔！你的身上怎么有椰奶拿铁的味道！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38716002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "突然好饿！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38716003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥莉安娜",
          "text": "你……你是星洛？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "38716004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "星洛",
          "text": "哎呀，你认识我，还有熟悉的味道！那你就是星洛的朋友了，要不要一起来吃美味的涂料呀~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-939",
